  "content": "<p>&nbsp; &nbsp;這個 Minecraft 世界被開挖到基岩層，並設有一座巨大的烽火台！這座烽火台的用途為何，留待玩家自行探索。它可是由多達 318 個方塊高的鑽石所組成的！在這個世界中自由遊玩，做你想做的事，或許可以前往包含這座巨型烽火台的巨坑世界邊界一探究竟。</p><p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/null/description_2cce048c-e1b7-42d9-ab4b-4451b1531ec6.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"847\" height=\"454\"></p><p>&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;&lt;video style=\"width: 219px; height: 438px;\" poster=\"\" controls=\"controls\" width=\"219\" height=\"438\"&gt; &lt;source src=\"https://www.youtube.com/shorts/zfeoZkZinI8\"&gt;&lt;/video&gt;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#fff\">願上帝保佑你，祝玩得開心 :)</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1218403/description_4a0c0c9d-0d30-4eab-aa14-a3beb58d2597.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"340\" height=\"191\"></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#3598db\">支持我！</span></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong><span style=\"color:#e67e23\"><a href=\"coff.ee/danielboonemc\" rel=\"nofollow\">coff.ee/danielboonemc</a></span><br></strong></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#f1c40f\"><strong>也來看看我的其他地圖！</strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/forest-and-fields-adventure-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">森林與田野</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/seven-survival-islands\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">七座生存島嶼</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/the-mysterious-island\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">神秘之島</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/pale-sky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">蒼穹空島</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/boones-sky-block\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">布恩的空島</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#2dc26b\"><strong><a style=\"color:#2dc26b\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/worlds/deserts-and-mountains-adventure-map\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">沙漠與山脈冒險地圖</a></strong></span></p><p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#fff\"><strong>J.M.J.</strong></span></p>",
